# Build and report output for this suite. Regenerated by Maven, Allure, Extent and the SHAFT
# performance hook on every run.
#
# The repository root .gitignore carries equivalent rules scoped to automation_baseline/**; these
# stay here as well so the suite keeps behaving correctly when it is copied into a Target Project
# or opened on its own, where that root file does not apply.
target/
*.class
allure-results/
allure-report/
extent-reports/
performanceReport/
execution-summary/
generatedReport_*.zip
.idea/
